# Keystone Homes & Land

Sage 11 WordPress **theme only** (`wp-content/themes/keystone-homes`). Repo: `matthummel-pa/keystone-homes-wp-theme`. WordPress core is not in this repo.

Matt is the owner (marketer). Prefer working in code. Keep copy editorial and local — rural Adams County farms, historic homes, and acreage — not generic luxury-broker voice.

## Fiction only

Listings, agents, phones, emails, appointments, and market stats are **sample / concept**. Not a live MLS, licensed brokerage, or booking system.

- Phones: `555` numbers (office `(555) 010-0455`)
- Emails: `@keystone-concept.test`
- ZIPs / street numbers: fake (`00000`, Concept Way)
- Keep the site-wide “concept demo · fiction only” disclaimer
- Do not invent real people, real listings, or real licensed-agent claims

## Two surfaces

| Surface | What it is | How it updates |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Theme** | Blade, CSS, JS, PHP, field defaults | Merge to `main` → GitHub Action publishes `theme-latest` zip → **Appearance → Update Theme** on the host |
| **Content** | Pages, listings, agents, posts, `ks_*` meta, options | Lives in WordPress. Editing theme files does not change live posts |

Live concept site: https://keystonehomes.ridgesandvalleys.com/

CI **does not FTP** to the host. Do not assume a theme PR is live until the zip is installed.

## Do not

- Enable the block editor or Gutenberg patterns
- Treat this repo as a full WordPress install
- Put secrets in the theme. GitHub token lives in Customizer / `KS_GITHUB_TOKEN`, never commit it
- Document rare setup steps here — see `AGENTS.md` and `README.md`

Edit these rules when an agent repeats a mistake. Files in `.cursor/rules/` must stay `.mdc`.
